### ========================================
### 6. VERIFICACIÓN DE CREDENCIALES (PÚBLICO)
### ========================================

### Verificar credencial por QR (respuesta pública)
GET {{baseUrl}}/credentials/verify/683a3f3f5a17990cc1142caa

###
# curl -X GET "http://localhost:4000/api/v1/templates" -H "Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjY4NTliNGNjNTc3Zjc1OWExN2VhMjQ1ZiIsImlhdCI6MTc1MDcxNjI2MCwiZXhwIjoxNzUzMzA4MjYwfQ.E7jIY89OhxiI5FIQ6oZapq2IlDwbYn-kkUfJjFN27Fg" -H "Content-Type: application/json"

### Verificar credencial por QR con detalles completos
GET {{baseUrl}}/credentials/verify-details/683a3f3f5a17990cc1142caa

### ========================================
### 7. REGISTRO DE IMPRESIONES
### ========================================

### Registrar una impresión de credencial
